{
  "key": 20239,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_Route24_Text_JustEarnedFabulousPrize",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations! You beat our\n",
        "five contest Trainers!\r",
        "You just earned a fabulous prize!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_Route24_Text_YouDontHaveAnyRoom",
      "en_US": "You don’t have any room!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_Route24_Text_ReceivedNuggetFromMysteryTrainer",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received a Nugget\n",
        "from the mystery Trainer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_MoveExtractor_Text_ChangedYourMind",
      "en_US": [
        "So? Changed your mind?\n",
        "Want to join Team Rocket?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_MoveExtractor_Text_WantToJoin",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way, how would you like to\n",
        "join Team Rocket?\r",
        "We’re a group of professional\n",
        "criminals specializing in Pokémon!\r",
        "Want to join?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_DadStory_Text_GruntInsists",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you sure?\r",
        "Come on, join us!\r",
        "I’m telling you to join!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_DadStory_Text_RivalMomHasSomething",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Oh, one last thing I forgot.\r",
        "I was back in Pallet Town checking on my\n",
        "Gym and ran into your Mom.\r",
        "She says she has something for you. You\n",
        "should go talk to her."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_MoveExtractor_Text_KeepStealing",
      "en_US": [
        "Keep stealing those moves, kid!\n",
        "I’ll come find you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_MoveExtractor_Text_Hmph",
      "en_US": "Hmph. Your loss, kid."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_MoveExtractor_Text_Surprised",
      "en_US": [
        "Wh-what?! You actually want\n",
        "to join?\r",
        "…I wasn’t expecting that.\n",
        "Nobody ever says yes.\r",
        "Uh… I mean, great! Welcome to…\n",
        "well, hold on a second.\r",
        "I’m just a Grunt. I can’t let\n",
        "people in. I don’t have that kind\f",
        "of authority.\r",
        "Tell you what. Prove your worth,\n",
        "and I’ll put in a good word with\f",
        "the higher-ups.\r",
        "Team Rocket steals Pokémon. But\n",
        "a real pro steals their Moves.\r",
        "Take this. Straight out of a Silph\n",
        "Co. lab. Don’t ask how I got it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_MoveExtractor_Text_HowItWorks",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a Move Extractor.\r",
        "In battle, use it after a foe uses\n",
        "a move. Your Pokémon learns that\f",
        "move… as a move of its own type!\r",
        "And the foe can’t use it anymore.\n",
        "Pretty slick, huh?\r",
        "It only breaks once your Pokémon\n",
        "learns the move. So choose well!\r",
        "Steal some good moves, and I’ll\n",
        "come find you. Later, recruit!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0362_R24_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
